==Trivia==
*Smol Heredit is the child of the [[Sol Heredit]].
*Smol Heredit's rare dialogue is a reference to an obscure copypasta.{{CiteReddit|author=pointtodns|url=https://www.reddit.com/r/copypasta/comments/6dmts5/ironically_deep/|title=Ironically Deep|quote=|date=27 May 2017|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20230607005427/https://www.reddit.com/r/copypasta/comments/6dmts5/ironically_deep/|archivedate=7 June 2023|notes=|name=}}
*Smol Heredit is one of the few boss pets in-game that is acquired as a main drop roll, sharing this trait with the [[abyssal orphan]], [[phoenix]], and [[tiny tempor]].
*Smol Heredit follows a different pathing algorithm than other pets. Rather than move diagonally first to move towards the player, Smol Heredit will prefer moving in cardinal directions, assuming both choices reach their destination in the same amount of time.

